s . \n\nUm imóvel pensado para quem busca qualidade de vida, tecnologia e segurança em um condomínio fechado com excelente infraestrutura.","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a8ba0f74d3e0f5317dcd37c/pilar-homes-images-watermark/f7f01d34-dda8-4304-94ac-7aa90c7da7a7.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a8ba0f74d3e0f5317dcd37c/pilar-homes-images-watermark/c4df33a2-2061-456b-823b-4da25e6af200.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a8ba0f74d3e0f5317dcd37c/pilar-homes-images-watermark/883016ef-1cda-4074-b5a3-bfe1a6665826.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a8ba0f74d3e0f5317dcd37c/pilar-homes-images-watermark/12b1dbfc-ca00-4e30-be7a-fc86521db02d.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a8ba0f74d3e0f5317dcd37c/pilar-homes-images-watermark/495f3ba7-2acc-410f-9a73-10a3deb9eeb4.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a8ba0f74d3e0f5317dcd37c/pilar-homes-images-watermark/03139dea-7db9-4aa7-8cd9-87d7877395fa.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a8ba0f74d3e0f5317dcd37c/pilar-homes-images-watermark/fef89cfb-1f5d-4dc2-8503-f9a0ecef14c9.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a8ba0f74d3e0f5317dcd37c/pilar-homes-images-watermark/3e24bbdf-e17f-4a76-99cc-10562cc6a512.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a8ba0f74d3e0f5317dcd37c/pilar-homes-images-watermark/0a7b9f8a-45ac-47e5-ad72-2254c957e69d.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a8ba0f74d3e0f5317dcd37c/pilar-homes-images-watermark/b099dba8-7494-4fc4-9d11-aba4ed878d19.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a8ba0f74d3e0f5317dcd37c/pilar-homes-images-watermark/b6c67d07-b9f2-43ad-a053-f4f6ac2cdf74.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a8ba0f74d3e0f5317dcd37c/pilar-homes-images-watermark/9e92264e-37cb-482d-beef-0640358a812b.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a8ba0f74d3